  "description": "Summer Operating Area: West Mediterranean -Naples/Sicily, Riviera/Corsica/Sardinia\nWinter Operating Area: Leeward Islands, Windward Islands\n\nL'OCTANT is a 15.60m / 51ft Catamaran Luxury Yacht built in 2018 by Neel Trimarans and later underwent a refit in 2022. Sleeping 6 guests in 3 cabins and with a crew of 2. Cruising at 9.00 kn/ph with a top speed of 12.00 kn/ph. The guest cabins comprise a Master cabin with a king size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities and 2 queen cabins with queen size bed and en-suite bathroom facilities.",
